# Public frontend (static assets)

- **Mobile roadmap:** [/MOBILE_DESIGN.md](../MOBILE_DESIGN.md) — layout mode (`layout-mobile` / `layout-desktop`), milestones M0–M6, DBV M2a–M2c, Collection **M4**, deck M5a–M5b, and **§10** (global-nav 2×2 + DBV All / Characters / Special / Aspects / **Missions** + Collection mobile notes). **Aspects** detail: [docs/current/DBV_ASPECTS_MOBILE.md](../docs/current/DBV_ASPECTS_MOBILE.md). **Missions** detail: [docs/current/DBV_MISSIONS_MOBILE.md](../docs/current/DBV_MISSIONS_MOBILE.md). **Collection tab MV:** [docs/current/COLLECTION_VIEW_MOBILE.md](../docs/current/COLLECTION_VIEW_MOBILE.md).
- **Global nav:** [`components/.cursorrules`](components/.cursorrules) (`globalNav.html` / `.js`, `header-nav-cluster`, `syncHeaderCollectionLayout`, mobile dropdown).
- **Card Database (DBV) agent context:** [`css/.cursorrules`](css/.cursorrules) (DBV CSS, `layout-mobile`, Special / Aspects / **Missions** tabs), [`js/.cursorrules`](js/.cursorrules) (DBV modules, All / Characters / Special / Aspects / **Missions** mobile, CDN image pattern). **DBV reusable filter UI:** power-type icon strip — [`js/DBV_POWER_TYPE_FILTER_STRIP.md`](js/DBV_POWER_TYPE_FILTER_STRIP.md); card/name text inputs — [`js/DBV_CARD_NAME_FILTER.md`](js/DBV_CARD_NAME_FILTER.md).
- **Entry HTML:** Canonical app shell is [`index.html`](index.html). Layout scripts: [`js/layout-mode.js`](js/layout-mode.js), [`js/viewport-positioning.js`](js/viewport-positioning.js). Mobile overrides: [`css/mobile-layout.css`](css/mobile-layout.css).
